implementationPlan.note:
executionReadiness.test.ts: 113 vitest rows, all green in the snapshot /tmp/moe-cf952313-iter, with tsc clean. It covers every planned row, plus these:
- relative install, key and project paths. They skip visibly only where no relative path exists, which happens on another Windows drive.
- a key with a trailing newline, and a directory at the key path;
- a key inside a .moe symlinked out of the project, and a .moe symlinked into the install;
- an absent .moe is still ready, while a looped .moe (ELOOP) fails closed;
- a duplicated failed row;
- full options toEqual on the recorded probe call;
- exactly PROBE_MAX_BYTES of output is accepted, and +1 byte is malformed;
- a guard-timer boundary: the timer is still pending at PROBE_TIMEOUT_MS+999;
- the guard timer is cleared on result, rejection and sync throw;
- a literal grouping table for CERTIFICATION_REFUSAL_IDS;
- a leaf-safety source row: exact import list, and no process./os./homedir/readFileSync.

TDD evidence: a scratch mutation sweep (/tmp/moe-cf952313-mut/mutate.mjs) applied 30 mutants to the snapshot copy. It found three gaps, now closed:
- the guard-boundary assertion was racy; it now uses getTimerCount;
- the probe-failure rows did not assert evidence; they now do;
- the `version === null ||` clause was redundant and is removed from the module, since a string compare already refuses null.
After the fixes, all 29 remaining mutants are killed.

The test file is 374 lines, over the 300-line default, because of the plan's row matrix. Comparable test files in this repo (CQ-M07a's) run ~400 lines.

executionContract.intendedBehavior:
evaluateExecutionReadiness(inputs) returns a deep-frozen ReadinessSnapshot for verified-local, computed only from facts the daemon observes through injected inputs:
- the daemon install tree is disjoint from the project;
- a valid runner key is filed outside the project;
- settings has an own deliveryPolicy of 'local-branch';
- CQ-M07a accepted a host certification report, and its provider version equals the live pinned Multipass client's.

It never rejects for a failing fact and never reads env, platform or home itself. Holding and wiring the snapshot belong to CQ-M07c.
